OL,3,GNEWSATributes for 107-year-old
OL,4,A'gentleman' RAF veteran
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid after the death
OL,7,Fof a 107-year-old who was present at
OL,8,Fboth Dunkirk and the D-Day landings.
OL,10,FColin Cole, from Gobowen in Shropshire,
OL,11,Fserved in the RAF during the war,
OL,12,Fspending four years flying sea rescue
OL,13,Fmissions then retraining as a teacher.
OL,15,FHis friend Mike Souttar, also from
OL,16,FGobowen, said he was "very fit" and
OL,17,F"terribly intelligent" as well as a
OL,18,F"total old-fashioned gentleman".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
