OL,3,GNEWSATributes for 107-year-old
OL,4,A'gentleman' RAF veteran
OL,5,
OL,6,FCole's neighbour, Bryan Davies, said he
OL,7,Fhad been "a man with a fascinating life
OL,8,Fstory and he loved to meet and talk to
OL,9,Fpeople".
